      "topic": "初次见面…",
      "text": "我是七星之「天权」，凝光。要做个交易吗？你来做我的贴身侍卫，而我，会教导你在璃月出人头地的技巧。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/12/6878652/2dac4753e90a11ba68cdf44806871e34_2268156472678192761.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·古玩",
      "text": "就算古玩价值连城，给人的快乐也只有刚拥有的一瞬。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/12/6878652/ecd1bf3872bb6d2750139e60c72093c9_8904473815122953563.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·商战",
      "text": "在商战中，完美的猎手不会留下任何痕迹。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/12/6878652/e68f3b32d09c76cbb5ce0bedd1cfcd21_5731733412343630525.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·投资",
      "text": "找笔新的投资吧。无论如何，摩拉都不会嫌多。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/12/6878652/cf0a19e175f663b473761a8b24c1cfdc_1241034612363504589.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候…",
      "text": "哦？下雨了啊。替我打伞吧。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/12/6878652/d945fe0c869aa002c8d0a6f52edc775c_7734015546314905723.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "诺艾尔": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "早上好···",
      "text": "早上好，早餐已经做好了哦。我就待在你身边，如果哪里不合口味，请随时告诉我。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/ad113acb4874ca73f00eada2e867c739_8717621365793931136.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·帮忙",
      "text": "交给我吧！什么都可以交给我！——对了，你要拜托我做什么来着？我还没来得及听…",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/a2e0dd29da56041feb32075741fe7d2d_9076671587095383424.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·休息",
      "text": "有点累了吗？那就在这里休息吧，我去为你沏茶，要全糖、半糖，还是无糖？",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/e47ed8e084033235b4243886743293df_7286447526488420317.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·可靠",
      "text": "只要你需要我，我随时都会出现在你的身边。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/c7818677bfec0c4922bef4c5fcad0a1b_8356013082763888698.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候···",
      "text": "糟了，大家的衣服还晾在外面！我能不能现在回去收拾一下？",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/17cd627f5408ac4bd4ce4588c765d3dc_5927070129613847918.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "菲谢尔": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "早上好·问候菲谢尔",
      "text": "昼夜时空皆为虚像，命运的纽带却再次将你带到了我的永恒长夜中。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/bd2912d54aa5f929c1cc7418975086a1_2625159167317091353.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "早上好·问候奥兹",
      "text": "奥兹：早上好！听说你要来，小姐在准备早点… 菲谢尔：奥兹！…咳，有何贵干？",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/ffc2964920bac242a09bfc7a091fd2c7_2943577356561219037.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "中午好···",
      "text": "（哈欠）…即使贵为皇女，在这样的时辰也不免困乏…",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/fcf7e54f9e61adac129f215f8f15d6d6_5749241785197009877.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "晚上好···",
      "text": "菲谢尔：天穹上的星光，都是奥兹在无尽的夜幕上啄出来的洞。 奥兹：是才怪啦！",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/eff449409b735a8115d13bbef8be1c38_2718953780163278997.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "晚安···",
      "text": "菲谢尔：你的深眠将平安无梦。毕竟，岂有梦魇，敢染指幽夜净土所祝圣之人… 奥兹：她说「晚安」。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/8073d31b6765f30b831825d55e5d221b_468537075888828585.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "琴": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "初次见面···",
      "text": "蒲公英骑士，琴，申请入队。从今往后，我的荣誉与忠诚将与你同在！",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/4359827/aaf3f91ee4b8c125d705d977882b1b19_243359684670373200.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·行动",
      "text": "行动起来吧，我们不该在这里停留。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/4359827/b99179897893cd61c648a5428c653575_1878856794213058817.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·骑士团",
      "text": "骑士团的大家…有没有认真工作呢？",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/4359827/b0676a8616e330781b564a2ba053d313_5379327920008899784.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·目标",
      "text": "走吧，前往下一个目标！",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/4359827/3185d9377eae3e6798c14e9425b59d5a_8574252867260738569.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候···",
      "text": "下雨也无法阻挡我的脚步。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/4359827/0c9c0b4a9a3a790d1b1f1bfddc5e42c5_8277558758469767513.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "迪卢克": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "初次见面…",
      "text": "蒙德城的迪卢克，应约而来。闲聊恕不奉陪，如果你是想做一番大事，我倒有点兴致。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/76953456/20aa35337a455d340d768d078c68b1a2_1350741812985750360.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·放松",
      "text": "偶尔悠闲一下，也不错。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/76953456/adf5981c5cca2827c27aa8b91ba4bafa_484052869323523610.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·骑士团",
      "text": "应该换骑士团的那些家伙来陪你。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/76953456/aae8960c42c402d88629abecb0ed0236_5626181726901545633.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·行会",
      "text": "行会里还有很多事，你要么在这休息，我回去看看。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/76953456/b27047e9e7a2ba92d03aa58f71de1f16_5590130387027318259.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候·清洗",
      "text": "雨吗，可惜洗刷不了那些污秽的心。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/29/145906584/81930a269b3c4e1f8af91aa75db75239_1921299136633044262.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "安柏": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "初次见面…",
      "text": "侦察骑士安柏，前来报到！今后有什么需要帮忙的，尽管说好啦！",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/21/4359827/2623217118c979b87a2b892de47ec5b7_6122859712241743791.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·兴趣",
      "text": "好想跑一会儿步呀。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/21/4359827/01042dd29e779427871eb5e7b69e67d9_2090675054405476089.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·挂念",
      "text": "要是被琴发现我们在偷懒，她会不高兴的。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/21/4359827/94729496c43ba20bc413bc6c15064e39_5463848398778661774.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·新发现",
      "text": "那边好像有什么奇怪的东西耶…不去看吗、不去看看吗？",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/21/4359827/38675fd991d3e522e295e69b80be9512_4524027291268873815.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候·担忧",
      "text": "下雨了…蝴蝶结会淋湿的…",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/21/4359827/898ad56a78ba81c0bafa50b128c34745_1493441295538242291.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "丽莎": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "早上好···",
      "text": "（哈欠）…早安，琴。嗯？不好意思，我看错了。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/6ef4740fd88e2a7d2494cd986bf7d7fb_7324732990507901225.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "中午好···",
      "text": "午休时间到了…",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/8c448d0f1d924745cb08efe14dc06a25_4596793729304143192.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "晚上好···",
      "text": "你还不睡吗？我已经困了呢…",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/bcaa6bd7036f11c18a23ece51903ca63_8899518343302354406.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "晚安···",
      "text": "你努力的样子，姐姐全都见到了哦。嗯…让我想想，给你什么奖励吧…",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/a5853bf1b4db741f578d4827c3b4e8e3_3668771402048007847.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·下午茶",
      "text": "明明是该喝下午茶的时间。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/07/31153611/61e2e4f02c5884a9fd55e435cf104a2f_5817140800966223011.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "凯亚": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "初次见面···",
      "text": "西风骑士团，凯亚。请让我与你同行吧。比起团里的差事，还是做你的护卫要有趣得多。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/55ffab03fe04278cd56293ce6de37dcb_4353195490944557832.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "早上好···",
      "text": "享受这一天吧。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/7faccce8c760a31e035b7b4c9828246e_4918271488518368140.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "中午好···",
      "text": "哟，要不要一起去酒馆坐坐？",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/e4e09e19ea119d242c992a40a6703cb2_5914955885305703412.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "晚上好···",
      "text": "你该不会怕黑吧...哦？那我…可找到新素材了。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/2bbb05488d582f5194fb70febc701516_968787374635091515.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "晚安···",
      "text": "这就要走了吗？那就下回见了，别让我等太久啊。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/31153611/8b31115490aac547211654c8d8b005b8_5055266408148678089.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "北斗": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "初次见面···",
      "text": "我是北斗，听过我的「南十字」船队吗？如果你也喜欢冒险，那就跟着我吧。我罩你。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/13/4359827/b3f72afd42a465ad7cfec05747cf7d05_6322318510995647552.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·切磋",
      "text": "想切磋的话，我随时奉陪。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/13/4359827/c34afea67b5876a68f0aa6587581b2e3_7084573988828115156.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·畅饮",
      "text": "啊——干完活，喝口酒。真畅快。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/13/4359827/4a5885a4d5ef8fc4442ef8f2145d9b1d_6167845221562331858.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·陆地",
      "text": "难得在陆地上逗留那么久，居然有点不习惯了。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/13/4359827/94d20d02f1e22db2a939da426afe2c30_741819674892463495.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候···",
      "text": "被困荒岛的时候，雨水就是宝贵的淡水来源。嗯···虽然现在是用不上啦。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/13/4359827/858d481154f62efbb01ad24f608db332_4518897075182946238.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "班尼特": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·宝藏",
      "text": "不如在周围找找看吧，说不定有宝藏呢！",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/28/6878652/9f4496bc4fe34e9cb7b3a63fbb5040b5_521492205098704428.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·冒险",
      "text": "好久没有和别人一起冒险了！我们走吧！",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/28/6878652/9facdbc584c3d014f964c86e9bfd718f_3225988364590807134.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·调侃",
      "text": "俗话说「等在原地是不会有好事发生的」，当然以我的运气来说，往哪里走都一样啦…",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/28/6878652/a024499657ce61fd7c6a1f2e03169c50_1950164475838161124.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候…",
      "text": "我冒险的时候，大多都是这种天气。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/28/6878652/ec699a2f4cf867039e1d108da8dcf051_7497676132989654465.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "打雷的时候…",
      "text": "啊！别和我站得太近，这样雷就不会劈到你了。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/28/6878652/307213d53abd485e27f2ac0a309e0dba_1733872461557484692.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "重云": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·驱邪之法",
      "text": "方士驱邪一靠咒术，二赖武艺。另辟蹊径亦可，但终非正道。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/11/76953456/c6acb7ef89c805abd44236cf7e6898b5_3991592702088142211.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·饮食",
      "text": "寒食饮冰利于平神静气…清心泡水辅以冰块饮下，对身体最好。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/11/76953456/456ca77edccb9fe712dd21da57afacca_7957842768453852162.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line03.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·口诀",
      "text": "驱邪缚魅，内外澄清，啊，呃…糟了，后半句口诀忘了。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/11/76953456/44357d8530eda2fadb89605d5671a8fc_5416278137268852261.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line04.mp3",
      "topic": "下雨的时候...",
      "text": "雨是无根水，是最澄净的水，对驱邪除魔大有帮助。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/11/76953456/6fa1114ce30a1a8a1370649fdb41bf31_6917245051212446255.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line05.mp3",
      "topic": "打雷的时候...",
      "text": "这落雷好大阵仗，妖邪也会惧怕的吧。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/11/76953456/4cf7e594ab50259d7613582b8d313b9d_4017508652701574523.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "行秋": [
    {
      "file": "line01.mp3",
      "topic": "初次见面···",
      "text": "在下行秋，不过书海一蠹。某虽不才，仍愿为君略尽绵薄。难得有机会说这种风格的台词，感觉还不错。",
      "source": "https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/03/12/4359827/c23f8a815b242ca004889d25c8c889a7_9199298264638937633.mp3"
    },
    {
      "file": "line02.mp3",
      "topic": "闲聊·无人夜",
      "text": "有时明月无人夜，独向昭潭制恶龙。",
